					{
						m_id = 2106840085
					}
					m_sNote = ""
					m_commentText = "Animations for \"Actions\" are (almost?) always animated against the \"Standing\" version of the pose, and only ever touch pelvis + upper body. This is a decision taken to minimize the amount of variants that need to be animated.\n\n(Legs and feet don't move, and are taken care of by IK, much later down the line, near the end.)"
